+// Phase lock of the guest vblank timer to the display refresh.
+//
+// Each sample is d = time from queueing a present to it being shown. With a
+// queued present mode, d is how long the frame waited for the next refresh
+// (plus compositor time). The timer phase is nudged so d settles at a small
+// margin: the flip then happens just before a refresh. The error is taken
